ct</a></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-6\"><a href=\"/login\"><button class=\"bg-secondary hover:bg-secondary/90 text-white font-bold py-2.5 px-8 rounded-[10px] text-sm transition-all active:scale-95 shadow-lg\">Login</button></a><a class=\"text-white hover:text-secondary font-bold text-sm transition-colors\" href=\"/welcome\">Sign Up</a></div></div><div class=\"lg:hidden\"><button class=\"text-white p-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-menu\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 5h16\"></path><path d=\"M4 12h16\"></path><path d=\"M4 19h16\"></path></svg></button></div></div></nav><main class=\"flex-grow\"><div class=\"flex flex-col w-full font-manrope\"><section class=\"relative w-full h-[75vh] min-h-[100vh] flex items-start overflow-hidden pt-[280px] md:pt-[360px]\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 z-0\"><img alt=\"All Service Rental Background\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"100vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fabout1.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fabout1.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fabout1.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fabout1.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fabout1.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fabout1.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fabout1.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fabout1.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fabout1.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/><div class=\"absolute inset-0 z-[2] about-hero-gradient\"></div><div class=\"absolute inset-0 z-[3] bg-black/40\"></div></div><div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 relative z-10\"><div class=\"max-w-[800px] flex flex-col gap-4\"><div class=\"w-fit flex items-center gap-2 uppercase tracking-wider font-[700] text-[#66DF75] text-[14px] tracking-[0.2em] with-line\"><div class=\"w-12 h-[2px] bg-[#66DF75]\"></div>Since 1994</div><h1 class=\"text-white uppercase about-hero-title\">About <span class=\"text-[#28A745]\">Us</span></h1><p class=\"text-gray-300 text-[18px] md:text-[22px] leading-relaxed max-w-[650px] font-[400]\">All Service Rental was founded on a singular architectural vision: to build the invisible engine of the global economy through unyielding kinetic precision.</p></div></div><div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-full h-32 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#00080D] to-transparent z-10\"></div></section><section class=\"w-full py-24 overflow-hidden bg-[#081D30]\"><div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 \"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-center\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-12\"><h2 class=\"text-white leading-[1.1] tracking-tight text-[32px] md:text-[40px] font-bold \">Our Architecture</h2><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10\"><div class=\"flex gap-6 group\"><div class=\"w-[3px] bg-[#28A745] h-auto self-stretch rounded-full\"></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3\"><div class=\"w-fit flex items-center gap-2 uppercase tracking-wider font-[700] text-[#66DF75] text-[14px] tracking-[0.2em] \">GLOBAL MONOLITH</div><p class=\"text-gray-400 text-[18px] leading-relaxed max-w-[500px]\">We operate as a single, unified entity across 142 countries, ensuring that logistics never feels like a series of handoffs, but a continuous flow.</p></div></div><div class=\"flex gap-6 group\"><div class=\"w-[3px] bg-[#28A745] h-auto self-stretch rounded-full\"></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3\"><div class=\"w-fit flex items-center gap-2 uppercase tracking-wider font-[700] text-[#66DF75] text-[14px] tracking-[0.2em] \">ZERO LATENCY</div><p class=\"text-gray-400 text-[18px] leading-relaxed max-w-[500px]\">In the kinetic economy, time is the only true currency. Our proprietary Stratum AI predicts bottlenecks before they manifest.</p></div></div></div></div><div class=\"flex justify-center lg:justify-end\"><div class=\"w-full max-w-[500px] p-10 md:p-14 rounded-[4px] relative overflow-hidden quote-box-glass\"><div class=\"mb-10\"><svg width=\"48\" height=\"48\" viewBox=\"0 0 48 48\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><circle cx=\"24\" cy=\"12\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#28A745\"></circle><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"24\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#28A745\"></circle><circle cx=\"36\" cy=\"24\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#28A745\"></circle><circle cx=\"18\" cy=\"36\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#28A745\"></circle><circle cx=\"30\" cy=\"36\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#28A745\"></circle><path d=\"M24 15V21M15 24H21M27 24H33M21 33L18 36M27 33L30 36\" stroke=\"#28A745\" stroke-width=\"2\"></path></svg></div><blockquote class=\"flex flex-col gap-8\"><p class=\"text-white text-[24px] md:text-[30px] font-[500] leading-tight italic\">&quot;Logistics is no longer about moving boxes; it is about managing the kinetic energy of global demand.&quot;</p><footer class=\"text-gray-500 text-[14px] font-[700] uppercase tracking-[0.2em]\">Our Service Doctrine</footer></blockquote></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"w-full py-24 bg-[#011428] overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6\"><div class=\"mb-20\"><h2 class=\"text-white text-[32px] sm:text-[48px] md:text-[56px] font-[700] uppercase tracking-tight mb-8\">Our Team</h2><div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center justify-between gap-6\"><p class=\"text-gray-500 text-[14px] font-[700] uppercase tracking-[0.2em]\">The Architects of Modern Trade</p><div class=\"hidden md:block flex-1 h-[1px] bg-white/10 ml-12\"></div></div></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8\"><div class=\"flex flex-col group \"><div class=\"relative aspect-[4/5] overflow-hidden grayscale group-hover:grayscale-0 transition-all duration-500\"><img alt=\"Marcus Vane\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" cl